WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.165
A busy diary can still hide an unready decision

00:00:04.047 --> 00:00:06.889
In this learning unit you will learn how planning

00:00:06.942 --> 00:00:12.205
creates a reliable executive-support partnership Diary management is one

00:00:12.257 --> 00:00:16.126
practical application your plan must fit the executive’s commitments

00:00:16.178 --> 00:00:19.731
and the plans of everyone who contributes A busy

00:00:19.797 --> 00:00:22.218
calendar does not show whether the right people are

00:00:22.218 --> 00:00:25.942
available the necessary papers are ready or a change

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:30.007
has been approved You will practise checking these conditions

00:00:30.047 --> 00:00:32.363
and recording them in a working agreement and a

00:00:32.428 --> 00:00:33.442
decision brief
